'''mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Start: Manual Process]) --> Identify[Identify Process]
    Identify --> Analyze[Analyze Requirements]
    Analyze --> Design[Design RPA Solution]
    Design --> Develop[Develop Bot]
    Develop --> Test[Test & Validate]
    Test --> TestPass[s11]
    TestPass -->|No| Develop
    TestPass -->|Yes| Deploy[Deploy to Production]
    Deploy --> Monitor[Monitor & Support]
    Monitor --> Optimize[Optimize Performance]
    Optimize --> EndNode([Process Automated])
    
    classDef processStep stroke:#818cf8,fill:#eef2ff
    classDef decision stroke:#fb923c,fill:#fff7ed
    classDef startStyle stroke:#4ade80,fill:#f0fdf4
    classDef endStyle stroke:#f87171,fill:#fef2f2
    
    class Identify,Analyze,Design,Develop,Test,Deploy,Monitor,Optimize processStep
    class TestPass decision
    class Start startStyle
    class EndNode endStyle
